<newsitem itemid="581590" id="root" date="1997-05-14" xml:lang="en">
<title>USA: Versa Technologies Inc Q4 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Versa Technologies Inc Q4 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.35		    $0.27</p>
<p> Oper net		   1,971		    1,616</p>
<p> Revs			26,351		   19,859</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,580		    5,928</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1997 excludes one-time charge associated with loss on the sale of Lovdahl Manufacturing. With the charge, reported net income was $1.8 million, or $0.33 for the quarter.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.13		    $0.99</p>
<p> Oper net		   6,355		    5,899</p>
<p> Revs			87,596		   70,699</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,601		    5,970</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full 1997 results exclude losses on sale of Lovdahl and Mox-Thermoplastics. Including those losses, reported net income was $5.7 million, or $1.02 a share.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
